      <h2>What Is a Percentage Calculator?</h2>
      <p>
        A <strong>percentage calculator</strong> computes the proportional relationship between parts and wholes. The word <em>percent</em> originates from the Latin phrase <em>per centum</em>, meaning "by the hundred".
      </p>
      <p>
        Instead of performing complex manual long division or multiplying decimals by hand, an online percentage calculator instantly applies standard mathematical formulas to provide clean, error-free results.
